This product includes software developed as part of the XRAPH ecosystem:

  - Forge (https://github.com/xraph/forge) — extension composition and host
    application framework.
  - Vessel (https://github.com/xraph/vessel) — dependency injection container.
  - Grove (https://github.com/xraph/grove) — ORM, storage drivers, migrations.
  - Fabriq (https://github.com/xraph/fabriq) — data fabric; single write path
    with derived graph and search projections.

Blackstart embeds no third-party numerical power-systems code. The Rust solver
is an original implementation, validated against pandapower and MATPOWER as
external reference tools. See docs/validation.md for the validation record.

Test system data distributed with or downloaded by this project is public and
carries its own terms. See data/cases/SOURCES.md and data/samples/SOURCES.md
for per-file source URLs, content hashes, retrieval dates, and license basis.
